        "Description": "The target is a notorious criminal who has thrown global traffic into chaos by dominating no-parking zones worldwide.He is feared as:\rCodename:&quot;Parking Violation Infinity&quot;\rHe is currently loitering at the cafe,plotting his next illegal parking scheme.Put a cold full stop to his atrocities,having blocked nearly 1,000 emergency vehicles.Method is up to you.\r[JPN]ターゲットは世界中の駐禁エリアを我が物顔で支配する史上最悪の常習犯、コードネーム「駐車違反インフィニティ」\r奴はサピエンツァのカフェで次なる駐車違反の計画を練っている。千台近い緊急車両を妨害した奴の凶行を止めろ。手段は問わない。",
